<!--
	Translation notes

	Strings in this file are html.  Be sure to wrap any text containing HTML
	formatting with <![CDATA[]]>, or the text may be truncated, due to the way
	that XML interprets tags in tags, versus strings.
	
	The cut scene word balloons have text fields as large as the bubbles them-
	selves.  Generally, this text is centered, and vertically centered (i.e. 
	if it's one or two lines, it should be centered, unless the artist has 
	scaled the text, which buggers the calculation.)  Put manual line breaks
	(i.e. <br/>) into the text to break the lines to conform to the balloon 
	shapes.  
	
	Where text is 'too big', you can resize the font with the appropriate HTML
	font tag.  
	<TOO_BIG><![CDATA[<font size="8">Was too big, now very small</font>]]></TOO_BIG>

	Text like '%TAGS%' should NOT be translated.  This is a placeholder where 
	a value or string will be substituted into the string.

	Where multiple copies of the same text identifier exist, the game 
	automatically cycles through them, randomly.  For variety.
-->

